# `pnpm cloud env:prod` / `pnpm cloud env:staging` write the Supabase pair into a managed block of `.env`, taken
# from apps/ui's profile. `pnpm dev:mobile` starts this workspace's Next server and points the app at
# it; set EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL here to use a deployed hub instead (no local Next is started then).
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-server.example
